  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hybrid Facilitation POMBI meeting A2F</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the Ghanian horticulture sector, the smallholder farmers and the small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in the Value Chain have difficulties accessing credit and other financial services. On 12 February a hybrid meeting will be organised with many stakeholders in both Ghana and The Netherlands, to create together a next step towards solutions, including the important question &#x201c;Who can contribute what, to solve this challenge?&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
